<p class="lt-chem-36350">A. The tosylate is formed with retained stereochemistry.</p>

<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-36350"><img alt="clipboard_e8910fd4f3384a1be59d43ec1ee79edff.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/399143/clipboard_e8910fd4f3384a1be59d43ec1ee79edff.png?revision=1" /></p>

