<p class="lt-chem-36350">As seen in the previous example, there are many examples of chiral compounds containing alcohols. One common example of these are sugars, is the given the following sugar, allitol, also chiral?</p>

<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-36350"><img alt="17_6_9.svg" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/389732/17_6_9.svg?revision=1" /></p>

